OL,3,GNEWSARural rugby club plans padel court
OL,4,Aexpansion
OL,5,
OL,6,FA rugby club has lodged plans to expand
OL,7,Finto the sport of padel by building
OL,8,Fcourts at its ground.
OL,10,FKirkby Lonsdale Rugby Club in Cumbria
OL,11,Fhas applied to Westmorland and Furness
OL,12,FCouncil for permission to build three
OL,13,Fpadel courts at Underley Park.
OL,15,FIn a document submitted to the council,
OL,16,Fclub member Alan Cook claimed the
OL,17,Fproject would "reinforce the rugby
OL,18,Fclub's role as an important social and
OL,19,Frecreational asset".
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
