OL,3,GNEWSARural rugby club plans padel court
OL,4,Aexpansion
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo courts would be covered, with one
OL,7,Funcovered, and would operate between
OL,8,F06:00 and 23:00 with dedicated parking.
OL,9,FA council consultation on the plans
OL,10,Fwill run until 16 November.
